The Licensor grants Your Group a limited, worldwide, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, royalty-free copyright license to reproduce and run an unmodified copy of the Software internally solely for Evaluation for one period of no more than 30 consecutive days.

That single Evaluation period begins when any member of Your Group first runs the Software on behalf of Your Group for Evaluation under this license. Merely viewing source or documentation or downloading an unexecuted copy does not start the period. Access to a newer release, version, branch, fork, mirror, copy, or build does not restart or create another Evaluation period for Your Group. The Licensor may extend or renew Evaluation only by express written permission.

