Publication under this section does not grant the Project Licensor commercial relicensing rights in another author's portions. Such additional rights require a separate valid grant, such as an applicable contributor agreement. The Project Licensor's commercial permission alone does not replace missing permissions from other rights holders.

Separate, independently developed components may remain under their own licenses if they are clearly identified and do not incorporate or derive from the Software. Mere communication through an API or protocol does not by itself make a component a Modification, even if the component is designed to work with GEL RAM. Incorporating or adapting GEL RAM code remains subject to this license; calling it a plugin, adapter, process or wrapper does not create an exception. Classification depends on the actual material and applicable law, not its name or deployment topology.

